          We developed BotSolar specifically for the GoodWe challenge with the goal of amplifying the impact of
          the brand's existing technologies. By combining data from the SEMS ecosystem with generative AI and automations,
          we created an interface that understands natural requests, interprets plant context, and responds with
          actionable recommendations.
        </p>
        <p>
          The team's focus was to build a solution demonstrable in real-time, capable of operating across different
          touchpoints — from the terminal to web chat and voice experiences — reinforcing how GoodWe can offer
          services that are increasingly intelligent and integrated for its consumers.
        </p>
